# Project Scope

The implementation documented in this repository covers the complete lifecycle of an authentication-based security investigation.

The project includes:

- Azure Resource Group deployment
- Azure Log Analytics Workspace configuration
- Microsoft Sentinel onboarding
- Custom log ingestion
- KQL query development
- SSH brute-force detection
- Threat hunting
- Incident investigation
- MITRE ATT&CK mapping
- Incident response recommendations

Although the example scenario focuses on SSH authentication logs, the concepts introduced throughout this handbook can be applied to many different data sources and detection scenarios.

